{"unit_id": "tag:01VQ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个态射（morphism），其源和目标均为概形（schemes）。\n设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）。\n若<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上相对甚丰沛（relatively very ample），则<MATH_0006>是分离（separated）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚丰沛"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指概形之间给定的态射。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指给定态射的源与目标所属的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "修饰引理中给定的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指给定概形上的可逆层。"}, {"source_term": "relatively very ample", "target_term": "相对甚丰沛", "context": "指引理对给定可逆层施加的相对丰沛性条件。"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "指引理结论中给定态射的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01VQ:proof", "translation": "分离（separated）这一性质在基底上是局部的（local on the base）（见《概形（Schemes）》第<REF_0001>节）。\n浸入（immersion）是分离（separated）的（见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0002>）。\n故该引理成立，因为局部地（locally），<MATH_0001>有一个浸入（immersion），其目标是一个分次环（graded ring）的齐次谱（homogeneous spectrum），而后者是分离（separated）的，见《构造（Constructions）》引理<REF_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "local on the base", "target_term": "在基底上是局部的"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部地"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "此处讨论分离性可在基底上局部检验。"}, {"source_term": "local on the base", "target_term": "在基底上是局部的", "context": "说明分离性的局部性是相对于基底而言。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指分离性局部性的出处所在章节。"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "指第二句断言具备分离性的一类态射。"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "指第二句断言浸入具备的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指浸入具有分离性这一引理的出处所在章节。"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部地", "context": "修饰通向齐次谱的浸入的存在断言。"}, {"source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入", "context": "指局部存在的、以齐次谱为目标的态射。"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "指构成该齐次谱所用的环。"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱", "context": "指用作局部浸入目标的谱。"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离", "context": "指所用齐次谱具备的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Constructions", "target_term": "构造", "context": "指齐次谱具有分离性这一引理的出处所在章节。"}], "notes": []}
